  https://github.com/orsonteodoro/muslx32/commit/d3c69a81fc47b3b8a56c7ff13897e644eef6aedc#diff-4e39c3bf1b6aba655e5780d658e0af3005fe6a8b26b10f2c60ecc42f8a86edb3

